kill auto-loading once and greeting once.\n\n- **Branded as a Ghost World Labs tool \"powered by NextGen Nuclear,\"** stdlib-only by rule (the `distro.py` import scan enforces it, allowing only the single `pywinpty` terminal exception).\n\nThese claims are grounded in the project's `CLAUDE.md` and the locked North-Star/decisions from the frozen `planning/rnd-v3` and `rnd-v4` design docs."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":45311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4410,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"566c740c-c26b-47f3-8d52-b3d3d33eed8a","uuid":"998eecd7-d0f2-4a1d-ba8b-984eb69fb533","request_id":"req_011Cc1JXHBrevYNqSDBZbNxC"}
